# UI (Tailwind v4 + shadcn)

- Tokens are defined only in `packages/ui/src/styles/globals.css` (`@theme inline`, oklch, light/dark via `.dark`). The reference token set is blueprint §32.4, with the compiled mockup CSS in `docs/mockups/src/app.css`. No `tailwind.config.*` and no hex colors or arbitrary color values in components.
- Custom utilities use v4 `@utility` (with nested `@variant` for breakpoints) in the shared CSS, not plugins.
- Add shadcn primitives to `packages/ui/src/components` via `components.json` (see `.agents/skills/shadcn`). App-specific compositions live in `apps/*/components`.
- Fonts: Barlow Condensed (display), Inter (UI) and Source Serif 4 (article body), via `next/font`.
- Screens should match the mockups in `docs/mockups/` (open the `.html` files or compare against `docs/mockups/screenshots/*.png`), **except the Transfer Portal Tracker**, whose UI is pending a redesign (Open Decision #17). For the tracker, follow only the layout technique: named `grid-template-areas` that restack on mobile.
- Accessibility: AA contrast for every token pair, visible focus states, semantic lists and tables, `aria-hidden` on decorative icons, and real `<a href="?page=n">` pagination links.
- Ads reserve their height (CLS ≤ 0.05). No sign-in modals on load. Follow and save prompts respect the prompt budget (§31).
- Images: use the `SanityImage` wrapper (`sanity-image`), AVIF/WebP, under 200 KB, with explicit dimensions, `priority` only on the LCP hero, and no upscaling.
